    "text (multi-line), lvtext (RTF or plain text), struct (components separated by |), object.",
    "since/until: first/last version that has the entry; names: other keyword by version (both are read).",
    "multiple: may repeat; required: mandatory in the syntax diagram; values: allowed codes.",
    "opaque objects are recognised but their content is not described (not mapped).",
    "The order of the children is the order of the rules where it is known; the reader does not enforce it."
